    "description": "Invalid free is caused by type confusion in WritePCDTile(): it fetches pixels from downsample_image into q, but then uses GetPixelGreen(tile_image,q)/GetPixelBlue(tile_image,q) and advances q with GetPixelChannels(tile_image). If tile_image and downsample_image channel layouts differ, q is interpreted with the wrong image metadata and stepped with the wrong stride, producing out-of-bounds reads and memory corruption. That corruption later manifests as a bad free in ImageToBlob()/RelinquishMagickMemory when the blob buffer pointer is no longer valid.",
